// Microsoft Sentinel scheduled analytics rule
// Rule name: Multiple Failed Entra ID Sign-ins
// Use case: repeated failed Entra ID sign-ins from the same user and source IP.
// Lab configuration: runs every 5 minutes with a 5-minute lookback (the rule's
// scheduling lookback bounds the ago(30m) filter below); alerts at 3 failures.
// ATT&CK: T1110.001 Brute Force: Password Guessing

SigninLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30m)
| where ResultType != 0
| summarize FailedAttempts = count() by UserPrincipalName, IPAddress, bin(TimeGenerated, 10m)
| where FailedAttempts >= 3
